s/photos/stock-engineer-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Engineer working on computer hardware\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/stock-engineer-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"01"},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"The problem"},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Microsoft 365, remote working and endpoint security had been introduced over several years by different providers. Although the environment functioned well, inconsistent authentication settings, administrator permissions and ageing devices made it difficult to demonstrate compliance."},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"02"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Our action"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"We completed a Cyber Essentials readiness review covering Microsoft 365 security, endpoint protection, authentication policies, device management and user permissions, then addressed the gaps that mattered most."},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"03"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"The result"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 6","default":"A consistent security baseline across users and devices, privileged accounts reduced by over 20%, and leadership with far better visibility into ongoing security management."},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"Figure 1","default":"24%"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"Figure label 1","default":"Less admin time on IT issues"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"Figure 2","default":"21%"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"Figure label 2","default":"Better staff efficiency"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"Figure 3","default":"4×"},{"k":"s17","type":"s","label":"Figure label 3","default":"Visibility across locations"},{"k":"s18","type":"s","label":"Figure 4","default":"5 mo"},{"k":"s19","type":"s","label"